            <ArticleTitle>Bicuspization of a quadricuspid truncal valve.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1510/mmcts.2017.002</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Though relatively rare, quadricuspid truncal valves are associated with significant valve regurgitation that often necessitates surgical correction. We present the repair of a quadricuspid truncal valve using a bicuspidization technique.</AbstractText>
